{"version":1,"content":"<p>廣發證券分析師Jeff Pu近日下調了2027年每一個季度的DRAM合約價預測，並在報告中首次給出2028年情景分析。按照基準情景，DRAM價格將在2028年減半，但這並不意味着內存超級周期已經結束，消費者也不太可能在明年買到更便宜的內存。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588140.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.865631+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:04:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"874f41f24c97b3f9a4fc552a8277ee14bc61a54fbc16ee355cc315be26369cba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}